{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">瑞银：美光NAND报价涨幅略降，DRAM供需比预期更紧</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>在最新一期美光科技研究报告中调整了模型：NAND合约价涨幅低于此前预期，但HBM的供需紧张程度比之前判断的更甚。报告将美光<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>财年每股盈利预测分别调整为74.13、184.89和265.65美元，其中<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>财年数字较此前上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，也明显高于市场一致预期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最值得看的判断不是美光盈利有多高，而是HBM供应紧张已经传导到英伟达的产品规格调整。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>的渠道调查显示，英伟达Rubin Ultra的VR300方案因HBM供应持续偏紧而做了降规处理，首版VR300每颗GPU配置384GB HBM4，后续版本在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>前后转向512GB HBM4E，低于此前预期的768GB。降规没有减少HBM消耗，反而因为更多VR300出货，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>行业HBM总消耗量从587亿Gb上调至615亿Gb。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXR5gibGbkSvThicZ06IjyZPaVKJmFraiaIRUHP4d0rD7bkibImYyicga54RPLWSalDHmH1kicSVoILn2XmicaTrKTuvPla23Sl0UyOB8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. HBM涨价幅度<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>，HBM4E单价可能超过每GB 30美元</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>行业HBM混合平均售价同比涨幅从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">79%</span>，美光自身HBM平均售价涨幅从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">61%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">72%</span>。HBM4E单价可能达到每GB 30美元以上。报告同时确认，存储供应商正在重新拉大HBM与普通DRAM之间的价差，这是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>自4月以来持续提示的方向。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看：HBM单价<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>不是因为成本上升，而是供给端产能确实排不出来。英伟达愿意为保供应而调整产品规格，说明HBM的瓶颈已经从需求拉动变成了供给约束。美光<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年HBM出货量维持在116.5亿Gb不变，但单价上调，收入弹性全部来自价格。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看HBM4E每GB超过30美元这个数字，它比HBM出货量更能反映供需失衡的程度。简单说，出货量不变而单价大幅<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>，说明当前约束在供给端而非需求端；我更关注的是HBM4E量产爬坡速度能否跟上英伟达的排产计划，这决定了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>价格能否维持。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWY9aU36qZibq3pcTzWRK96Q5RXSjJ3NZTTLmcRDiccvYniaUiaMyPVhD2cpgdIrTUcvfQribJxrHGyiaO4bVHshP1zjkUNWjgEibUXuo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. NAND涨价幅度<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>，但周期顶点推迟到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">NAND是这份报告的主要<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">下修</span>项。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>行业合约价环比涨幅从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28%</span>下调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>，美光自身从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>下调至23%。下调原因是服务器和企业级SSD需求强劲，但智能手机和PC需求偏弱，抵消了部分涨幅。即便如此，UBS仍将2026和2027年NAND行业位元需求增长预测上调至23%和26%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告给出的一个重要证据是长江存储的产能分配方向。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>认为，长江存储每年约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.5万</span>片晶圆的新增产能中，约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3万</span>片投向DRAM而非NAND。这一判断如果成立，意味着NAND供给增量比市场预期的少，价格周期顶点可能从早前判断推迟到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里更值得关注的是NAND与DRAM的产能联动。长江存储把产能转向DRAM，短期缓解NAND供给不确定性，但长期看是在切入DRAM市场。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">UBS</span>在正文中专门提到，市场对长鑫存储产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>的担忧有些过度，理由是安装、良率和技术差距仍然存在。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX955L0FTjH5PfbVFHnGk8Q8Hfc5pjzq2p2UIU3ShWibiaMroPYkJNdic6snDar3iar3mcO9CP4lOeNvRvF1SGJgwK8LTBAF1yZvno/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVUtpnKv3QGoaaGyg8WeMupXK8ahsGG250UpkAzmBRFG5fibxhMTruWqygv3Wfo2vqFsR5DOfMJiaLD0eMK22FLuOAryZalQwRF0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 58-UBS-Micron Technology Inc A Bit of NAND Noise- But DRAM Is Even Tighter Than Our Prior Expectations- 报告观点-260810</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
